#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1259
msgid ""
"ZapFast keeps your unreadable archive as a separate file, creates a new one, "
"and asks you to link again. Linking again brings back recent history from "
"your phone. Afterwards, remove the old ZapFast entry under Linked devices on "
"your phone."
msgstr ""
"ZapFast 会把无法读取的存档另存为单独的文件，新建一个存档，并请你重新关联。重"
"新关联后，最近的历史记录会从手机恢复。之后，请在手机的“已关联的设备”中移除旧"
"的 ZapFast 条目。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1263
msgid ""
"If you can restore the original keyring instead, choose Cancel and Try "
"again: nothing is lost that way."
msgstr ""
"如果你能恢复原来的密钥环，请选择“取消”，然后选择“Try again”：这样不会丢失任何"
"内容。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1266
msgid "Start over"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1274
msgid ""
"This removes the message from your phone and linked devices. Other people "
"keep their copy. Connect to WhatsApp to delete it. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"这会从你的手机和关联设备中删除此消息。其他人仍保留自己的副本。连接 WhatsApp "
"后才能删除。此操作无法撤销。"

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1275
